Package: pcloud-rs
Version: 0.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: pcloud-rs maintainers <maintainers@example.invalid>
Depends: libc6, libssl3 | libssl1.1, libsqlite3-0, libfuse3-3, fuse3
Recommends: ca-certificates
Homepage: https://github.com/ezechiel203/pcloud-rs
Description: pCloud command-line client and user-space daemon (Rust rewrite)
 Provides the `pcloud-rs` CLI and the `pcloudd` background daemon for
 syncing, mounting, and managing pCloud accounts. This is the Rust
 rewrite of the historical C/C++ pcloud-rs client.
